  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "bridgev2-rlds-cache",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tBridgeData V2 RLDS Cache\n\t\n\nThis repository mirrors a local TFDS/RLDS cache for BridgeData V2 in a layout that can be used as a TFDS data directory.\n\nDataset directory: bridge_dataset/1.0.0\nTrain shards: 1024\nValidation shards: 128\nTotal files: 3493\nTotal bytes: 132487332614\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tUsage\n\t\n\nAfter downloading or cloning this dataset repository, point TFDS-style loaders at the repository root so that bridge_dataset/1.0.0 is visible under the data directory.\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/quiet-storm/bridgev2-rlds-cache.",
